      },
      "type": "data_flow",
      "old_value": "HSD_MemAlloc associates the assertion payload with its check of the address returned by OSAllocFromHeap. When that assertion fails, the assertion handler reports the failed expression and sends the source and line information through HSD_Panic; successful allocation returns the address without entering that diagnostic path.",
      "disposition": "supersede",
      "reason": "Differentiate the two owned string contributions and conditional line selection.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "code",
