      },
      "type": "data_flow",
      "old_value": "Receives a signed byte count from its caller. For a positive count, it obtains the active heap handle from HSD_GetHeap and passes that handle with the count to OSAllocFromHeap; the resulting address is checked by HSD_ASSERT and then returned to the caller. Nonpositive input produces NULL without consulting or modifying the heap.",
