      "type": "data_flow",
      "old_value": "HSD_Free forwards its pointer unchanged, together with the heap handle returned by HSD_GetHeap, to OSFreeToHeap. HSD_MemAlloc returns NULL without consulting the heap for nonpositive byte counts; otherwise it passes the HSD heap handle and requested byte count to OSAllocFromHeap, asserts that the resulting address is non-NULL, and returns that address.",
